[CmdletBinding()]param([Parameter(Position=0)][ValidateSet('template','estimate','doctor','help')][string]$Command='estimate',[string]$InputPath,[string]$OutputPath=(Join-Path $PWD ('s8-migration-estimator-'+(Get-Date -Format 'yyyyMMdd-HHmmss'))),[decimal]$HourlyRate=0,[decimal]$ThroughputGBPerDay=250,[int]$WorkHoursPerDay=8)
Set-StrictMode -Version Latest;$ErrorActionPreference='Stop';if($PSVersionTable.PSVersion.Major-lt5){throw'PowerShell 5.1 or 7+ required.'}
if($Command-eq'help'){Write-Output 's8migrate template | estimate -InputPath migration.csv [-HourlyRate 175] [-ThroughputGBPerDay 250]';exit};if($Command-eq'doctor'){[pscustomobject]@{PowerShell=$PSVersionTable.PSVersion.ToString();ThroughputGBPerDay=$ThroughputGBPerDay}|Format-List;exit};New-Item -ItemType Directory $OutputPath -Force|Out-Null
if($Command-eq'template'){@([pscustomobject]@{Workload='SharePoint';Name='Intranet';Objects=25;SizeGB=500;Complexity='Medium';UnsupportedItems=3;PermissionSets=80;Users=400;Notes='Example'})|Export-Csv (Join-Path $OutputPath 'migration-input-template.csv') -NoTypeInformation -Encoding UTF8;exit};if(-not$InputPath-or-not(Test-Path $InputPath)){throw'estimate requires a valid -InputPath'};$input=@(Import-Csv $InputPath);$rows=@();foreach($i in $input){$f=switch($i.Complexity){'Low'{1.0}'Medium'{1.35}'High'{1.8}'Critical'{2.4}default{1.35}};$o=[decimal]$i.Objects;$sz=[decimal]$i.SizeGB;$u=[decimal]$i.UnsupportedItems;$p=[decimal]$i.PermissionSets;$users=[decimal]$i.Users;$d=[math]::Ceiling(4+[math]::Min(80,[math]::Ceiling($o/1000)*2)+$p*.03);$r=[math]::Ceiling(($u*4+$p*.04)*$f);$m=[math]::Ceiling(($sz/$ThroughputGBPerDay)*$WorkHoursPerDay*$f);$v=[math]::Ceiling((4+[math]::Min(40,[math]::Ceiling($o/5000))+[math]::Sqrt([double]$users))*$f);$pm=[math]::Ceiling(($d+$r+$m+$v)*.15);$h=$d+$r+$m+$v+$pm;$rows+=[pscustomobject]@{Workload=$i.Workload;Name=$i.Name;Risk=if($f-ge1.8-or$u-gt5){'High'}elseif($f-ge1.35){'Medium'}else{'Low'};DiscoveryHours=$d;RemediationHours=$r;MigrationHours=$m;ValidationHours=$v;ProjectHours=$pm;TotalHours=$h;EstimatedCost=if($HourlyRate-gt0){$h*$HourlyRate}else{$null};TransferDays=[math]::Ceiling($sz/$ThroughputGBPerDay)}};$summary=@([pscustomobject]@{Workloads=$rows.Count;TotalHours=($rows|Measure TotalHours -Sum).Sum;EstimatedCost=if($HourlyRate-gt0){($rows|Measure EstimatedCost -Sum).Sum}else{$null};Mode='Offline and non-destructive'});foreach($pair in @(@('migration-estimate',$rows),@('migration-summary',$summary),@('migration-input-evidence',$input))){@($pair[1])|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 20|Set-Content (Join-Path $OutputPath "$($pair[0]).json") -Encoding UTF8;@($pair[1])|Export-Csv (Join-Path $OutputPath "$($pair[0]).csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding UTF8};(($summary|ConvertTo-Html -Fragment)+($rows|ConvertTo-Html -Fragment))|Set-Content (Join-Path $OutputPath 'index.html') -Encoding UTF8;[pscustomobject]@{Output=$OutputPath;Workloads=$rows.Count;TotalHours=$summary[0].TotalHours;Mode='Offline'}
